## Objective

Reconcile the authoritative geometric-intelligence roadmap, repository documentation, milestone, and native GitHub issue graph after #983 established `UNAVAILABLE_ZERO_CONSTRUCTION_TRANSFER`.

The update must select one evidence-bound successor path: corpus-induced semantic placement, a per-route self-plus-six harmonic link-state field, and candidate-relative signed transport are tested before any further generation, while exact H4/E8/SpiralCore/prime-route structure remains the addressing, ordered-state, transport, and control substrate unless it earns causal semantic discrimination.

## Scope

- create one fresh successor research issue with a frozen construction/validation split, per-route harmonic link-state rows, candidate-relative signed zero-sum radial/angular contrast, explicit table-native value baseline, matched link/distance/causal controls, anti-recall evidence, and decision-bearing terminal branches;
- transfer #953's native blocker from completed-negative #983 to that successor without running or modifying #953;
- close #983 only after preserving its negative evidence and linking the successor decision;
- update #820, milestone 21, ROADMAP, authoritative programme/evaluation/research documentation, current entry points, and terminology needed to make Now/Next/Later sequencing consistent;
- state that fixed zeta data are reused rather than recomputed, compiler-side float/allocation are allowed during qualification, and base-256 integer/LUT lowering follows only after causal transfer;
- preserve the distinction among addressing/state, attention, semantic value, generation, correctness, and reasoning.

## Out of scope

- no implementation or execution of the successor mechanism;
- no #953 decoded generation, fixture tuning, or replay;
- no #973 higher-scope work, correctness, reasoning, chat, optimization, formal closure, or release QA;
- no new novelty claim, E8 attention claim, collision-free hex-hive claim, or proof that exact algebra supplies semantics;
- no broad tests, model/teacher runs, corpus-scale jobs, or zeta-zero computation.

## Definition of done

- [x] one coherent Now/Next/Later plan exists in the authoritative repository mirrors;
- [x] the successor issue has a frozen, falsifiable contract and is a native child of #820;
- [x] native blocker edges and issue states/assignments match the documented order;
- [x] #983 remains immutable negative evidence and is closed only after the handoff is linked;
- [x] #953 remains untouched, unassigned, and blocked by the successor;
- [x] #820, milestone 21, and affected issue bodies/comments reflect the same plan;
- [x] focused documentation/claim checks pass and protected delivery lands through a PR;
- [x] the issue is closed with the protected merge commit and exact GitHub evidence.

## Delivery boundary

This issue carries governance and documentation only. The successor experiment remains a separate unassigned issue. Use named-path staging and the protected merge queue. Missing code/model/corpus evidence is `NOT_RUN`, never PASS.

